. Where they crossed is debated.","path":[[31.834,30.799],[32.1,30.55],[32.283,30.468],[32.55,29.95]],"mi":75},{"p":"marah","ref":"Exodus 15:22-26","note":"The water was bitter. Moses threw a log into it and it became sweet.","path":[[32.55,29.95],[32.933,29.35]],"mi":47},{"p":"elim","ref":"Exodus 15:27","note":"Twelve springs and seventy palm trees. They camped by the water.","path":[[32.933,29.35],[32.981,29.306]],"mi":4},{"p":"rephidim","ref":"Exodus 17:1-16","note":"Water from the rock. Israel defeated Amalek while Moses held up his hands.","path":[[32.981,29.306],[33.842,28.731]],"mi":65},{"p":"mountsinai","ref":"Exodus 19:1-20","note":"God met Moses on the mountain and gave the law. Its location is debated.","path":[[33.842,28.731],[33.973,28.54]],"mi":15},{"p":"kadeshbarn","ref":"Numbers 13:26","note":"From here the spies went into Canaan. Israel stayed in this region for many years.","path":[[33.973,28.54],[34.2,29.3],[34.42,30.64]],"mi":148}],"bbox":[31.834,28.54,34.42,30.799],"relief":{"src":"bible/fact/relief_levant.jpg","box":[30,26,39,35]}},"ruth":{"title":"Naomi and Ruth return","refs":"Ruth 1","when":"Time of the judges","miles":53,"note":"Their starting point in Moab is not named. Approximate.","debated":false,"places":{"moab":["Moab","",35.783,31.497],"jericho":["Jericho","",35.444,31.871],"bethlehem":["Bethlehem","",35.207,31.705]},"stops":[{"p":"moab","ref":"Ruth 1:1-18","note":"Naomi's husband and sons died in Moab. Ruth chose to go with her: “Your God will be my God.”"},{"p":"jericho","ref":"Ruth 1:19","note":"Not named in Ruth. The usual crossing of the Jordan from Moab was near Jericho.","way":1,"path":[[35.783,31.497],[35.55,31.83],[35.444,31.871]],"mi":34},{"p":"bethlehem","ref":"Ruth 1:19-22","note":"They arrived as the barley harvest began. The whole town was stirred.","path":[[35.444,31.871],[35.235,31.777],[35.207,31.705]],"mi":19}],"bbox":[35.207,31.497,35.783,31.871],"relief":{"src":"bible/fact/relief_levant.jpg","box":[30,26,39,35]}},